      "statement": "For /ask the frontend streams the response via res.body.getReader() and a TextDecoder, appending each decoded chunk to the last assistant message so markdown renders progressively; /feedback and /reset instead read the whole body with await res.text(). The /upload flow does NOT stream — it submits a Celery job and polls /jobs/{job_id} for the result.",
